"A" = Ban public gatherings and restrict their platform, but allow private discussion and written correspondence.
"B" = Permit all speech while ensuring equal access for counter-arguments and mainstream viewpoints.
"C" = Implement the full ban—radical ideas that threaten our system must be suppressed completely.
"D" = Actively protect their right to speak and organize, treating them no differently than any other group.
"E" = Allow their speech but increase monitoring to detect if they pose any actual threat to security or law.

